```bash
# 1. Add to Gemfile
gem 'query_guard'
bundle install

# 2. Analyze existing migrations
bundle exec queryguard analyze db/migrate

# 3. Add to CI (copy example workflow above)
mkdir -p .github/workflows
# ... paste workflow YAML ...

# 4. Commit
git push

# 5. Watch PR checks run
# Your next PR with migrations will be analyzed automatically
```

